                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The trap floods the starship with infernal heat. Crew members helming a battle station take @Damage[2d8[fire]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:22|basic] save. On a failure, the battle station they're helming becomes malfunctioning until the trap is disabled or the station is repaired.</p>"
